# The web client's unit tests, one repo-relative path per line.
#
# These files stay in scripts/tests/unit/ (the root unit tier still runs every
# one of them); this list is the SUBSET the web-client merge gate runs on its
# own (`bun run --cwd frontend test`, .github/workflows/frontend.yml). A file
# here either executes client JS from frontend/public/assets/js or asserts on
# the shipped client files (views, css, skills, docs fragments).
#
# scripts/tests/unit/web-client-unit-list.test.ts keeps this list honest: every
# path must exist, and every unit test that imports client JS must be listed.
# Add a line when you add such a test; the guard tells you if you forget.

